"Artonan consulates now exist mostly for superhuman registration and for classes."
"Consulates teach a two-week Artonan language intensive over winter break."
"'A History of Artonan Life' earns college credit, and often high school credit, by test."
"That history course includes a two-hour session on irrigation."
"Consulates also teach culture, Beginners Wordchaining and an intro to one Artonan script."
"Artonan instructors teach by magic screen from another universe, like moving bas-relief."
"Students leave their shoes in cubbies, since shoes are rude before an Artonan teacher."
"The Chicago consulate has faced two attempted bombings and a handful of enraged superhumans."
